<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay inflation 0.3 pct in September.</title>
<headline>Paraguay inflation 0.3 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguayan inflation was 0.3 percent in September versus 0.4 percent in August and 0.2 percent in September 1995, the Central Bank said Thursday.</p>
<p>Accumulated inflation in the first nine months of the year was 7.5 percent, down from 8.3 percent in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Twelve-month inflation to the end of September was 9.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion Newsroom, 595 21 444527/8</p>
